  nodeId: PV - Page 5
  speakerName: 
  lineText: "<b>Visuals</b>\r\nWide shot\u2014the hooded figure stands, steps over
    the broken porcelain, slips out of the office, and pulls the heavy office door
    shut behind them as the lock engages.\r\n\r\n<b>Narrative</b>\r\nThe killer leaves
    the room locked. However every digital key card should leave a trail...\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<i>No.
    of Panels: 3</i>\r\n<i>1. Killer stepping over the vase</i>\r\n<i>2. Leaves the
    room</i>\r\n<i>3. Closes the door</i>\r\n\r"
